	<section_number>29.1-518</section_number>
	<catch_line>When killing of beaver permitted</catch_line>
	<text>
		When beaver are damaging crops or lands, the owner of the premises, his agent or tenant, may kill the animals, or have them killed.
	</text>
	<history>1958, c. 147, § 29-139.1; 1987, c. 488; 2004, c. 421.</history>
